{"id": "EUVD-2026-97631", "enisaUuid": "148e71ae-ba0f-3edc-b8a6-72808bbe4aaf", "description": "Admidio 4.3.2 through 4.3.17 and 5.0.0 before 5.0.15 contains a broken access control vulnerability that allows role administrators to assign users to roles in other organizations. Attackers can submit crafted assign requests to members_assignment.php with a foreign role UUID to gain privileged membership, log into that organization, and edit its user profiles.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:19", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:54:16", "baseScore": 8.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Admidio/admidio/security/advisories/GHSA-ggch-5cpv-rvqx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/admidio-4.3.2-through-4.3.17-and-5.0.0-before-5.0.15-cross-organization-access-control-bypass-via-members-assignment-php"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h6qv-2m44-96j9", "CVE-2026-109329"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "45dfb103-c269-3a2e-ace0-08c0c9384efa", "product": {"name": "admidio", "vendor": {"name": "Admidio"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 <5.0.15"}, {"id": "e7c417a7-e4f7-36ac-b7be-f03c167ab4cf", "product": {"name": "admidio", "vendor": {"name": "Admidio"}}, "product_version": "4.3.2 \u22644.3.17"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1aaf5b59-28b3-3674-bd16-9846bb0b0a9d", "vendor": {"name": "Admidio"}}], "isExploited": false}